<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<%@ include file="common/header.jspf" %><c:url var="newWorkUrl" value="/works/new"><c:param name="title" value="${filter.keyword}"/></c:url><div class="intro-row"><p>함께 사용하는 작품 목록에서 검색하고, 나의 기록을 남겨보세요.</p><div class="intro-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="<c:url value='/works/search-external'/>">🔍 외부 작품 검색</a><a class="button secondary" href="<c:out value='${newWorkUrl}'/>">＋ 작품 직접 등록</a></div></div><style>.intro-actions{display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:0.5rem;}</style><form class="panel pad filters" method="get" action="<c:url value='/works'/>"><%@ include file="common/filter.jspf" %></form><c:if test="${not queryError}"><c:choose><c:when test="${empty works}"><div class="panel empty"><span aria-hidden="true">▤</span><h2>찾는 작품이 아직 없어요.</h2><p>제목과 유형으로 다시 찾아보거나 직접 등록해 주세요.</p><div class="form-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="<c:url value='/works'/>">검색 조건 초기화</a><a class="button" href="<c:out value='${newWorkUrl}'/>">작품 직접 등록</a></div></div></c:when><c:otherwise><div class="work-grid"><c:forEach items="${works}" var="w"><article class="work-card panel"><div class="work-cover ${w.mediaType=='TV'?'tv':''}" aria-hidden="true"><span><c:out value="${w.mediaType=='MOVIE'?'CINEMA':'SERIES'}"/></span><strong><c:out value="${w.title}"/></strong><small><c:out value="${w.releaseYear}" default="MY WATCH JOURNAL"/></small></div><div class="work-info"><c:set var="myWork" value="${myWorks[w.id]}"/><span class="pill"><c:out value="${w.mediaType=='MOVIE'?'영화':'드라마'}"/></span><h2><a href="<c:url value='/works/${w.id}'/>"><c:out value="${w.title}"/></a></h2><p class="muted"><c:out value="${w.genreNames}" default="장르 미지정"/></p><p class="work-personal"><span>나의 상태: <strong><c:out value="${stateLabels[myWork.currentState]}" default="미지정"/></strong></span><span>감상 기록 <c:out value="${myWork.recordCount}"/>건</span></p><c:url var="quickRecordUrl" value="/records/new"><c:param name="workId" value="${w.id}"/><c:param name="action" value="COMPLETE"/></c:url><div class="card-actions"><a class="button small" href="<c:out value='${quickRecordUrl}'/>">감상 남기기<span class="sr-only"> · <c:out value="${w.title}"/></span></a><a class="link" href="<c:url value='/works/${w.id}'/>">상태·이력 →</a></div></div></article></c:forEach></div></c:otherwise></c:choose><%@ include file="common/pagination.jspf" %></c:if><%@ include file="common/footer.jspf" %>
